 "title": "签名之前",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 117.38,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "验证者这一端，风险出在签名上。",
   "spoken": "验证者这一端，风险出在签名上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "罚没，是 PoS 验证者违反协议，被扣除部分质押并强制退出。",
   "spoken": "罚莫，是 PoS 验证者违反协议，被扣除部分质押并强制退出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.94,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 4.94,
   "speechEnd": 10.909
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "最常见的原因是双签。",
   "spoken": "最常见的原因是双签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 11.32,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 11.32,
   "speechEnd": 13.492
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "同一把密钥，对同一个位置，签了两个不同的消息。",
   "spoken": "同一把密钥，对同一个位置，签了两个不同的消息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 13.94,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 14.035,
   "speechEnd": 18.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "凌晨，运维看到主机 A 失去响应，就在备用机 B 上启动同一把密钥。",
   "spoken": "凌晨，运维看到主机 A 失去响应，就在备用机 B 上启动同一把密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 18.8,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 18.8,
   "speechEnd": 24.884
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "其实 A 没有停，两台机器对同一个 slot 各签一票。",
   "spoken": "其实 A 没有停，两台机器对同一个 slot 各签一票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 25.34,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 25.34,
   "speechEnd": 29.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "网络检测到双签，验证者被罚没。",
   "spoken": "网络检测到双签，验证者被罚莫。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 30.2,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 30.297,
   "speechEnd": 33.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "公开的罚没事件，几乎都发生在故障切换或迁移时。",
   "spoken": "公开的罚莫事件，几乎都发生在故障切换或迁移时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 33.46,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 33.55,
   "speechEnd": 38.56
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "2021 年 2 月，一家质押服务商重启出错，75 个验证者被罚没，约 18 ETH。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 2 月，一家质押服务商虫启出错，75 个验证者被罚莫，约 18 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 38.96,
   "dur": 8.72,
   "speechStart": 38.96,
   "speechEnd": 47.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "2023 年 10 月和 2025 年 9 月，Lido 和 SSV 网络上，也各有一批验证者被罚没。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 10 月和 2025 年 9 月，Lido 和 SSV 网络上，也各有一批验证者被罚莫。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 47.9,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 47.9,
   "speechEnd": 55.257
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "防线在流程，迁移前导出防罚没数据，确认旧实例已经停止。",
   "spoken": "防线在流程，迁移前导出防罚莫数据，确认旧实例已经停止。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 55.72,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 55.72,
   "speechEnd": 60.934
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "再等待至少 2 个 epoch，并开启分身检测，作为最后一道防线。",
   "spoken": "再等待至少 2 个 epoch，并开启分身检测，作为最后一道防线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 61.3,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 61.3,
   "speechEnd": 66.58
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "签名的另一个风险，是看不见就签。",
   "spoken": "签名的另一个风险，是看不见就签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 67.04,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 67.13,
   "speechEnd": 69.989
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "在 MEV-Boost 里，relay 托管构建者组装的完整区块，只给提议者区块头。",
   "spoken": "在 MEV-Boost 里，relay 托管构建者组装的完整区块，只给提议者区块头。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 70.38,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 70.38,
   "speechEnd": 77.243
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "提议者签名区块头，相信 relay 会发布完整区块并付款。",
   "spoken": "提议者签名区块头，相信 relay 会发布完整区块并付款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 77.64,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 77.64,
   "speechEnd": 82.58
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "2023 年 4 月，一个恶意提议者，签了一个无效的区块头。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 4 月，一个恶意提议者，签了一个无效的区块头。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 82.98,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 83.083,
   "speechEnd": 88.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "旧代码照样返回区块体，他拆开三明治机器人的交易包，获利约 2000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "旧代码照样返回区块体，他拆开三明治机器人的交易包，获利约 2000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 89.28,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 89.28,
   "speechEnd": 97.03
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "修复后，relay 先广播区块，再把区块交给提议者。",
   "spoken": "修复后，relay 先广播区块，再把区块交给提议者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 97.5,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 97.5,
   "speechEnd": 101.858
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "relay 是可信中间人，验证者要评估自己用的 relay 和它的运营方。",
   "spoken": "relay 是可信中间人，验证者要评估自己用的 relay 和它的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 102.28,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 102.374,
   "speechEnd": 107.536
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "这个市场也很集中，2026 年 11 月的一个单日快照里，前两大构建者约占 74% 的区块。",
   "spoken": "这个市场也很集中，2026 年 11 月的一个单日快照里，前两大构建者约占 74% 的区块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
